      "heading": "Features of Muse Glimmer 30B in nutshell:",
      "body": "This model size is about 29.6 billion parameters Model type is Dense causal transformer with a perception encoder Context size 131,072 tokens or…",
      "durationInFrames": 330
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "AI Tools",
      "heading": "What can Muse Glimmer do?",
      "body": "Muse Glimmer targets several tasks that need more than a single answer. It can write and debug code, call tools, inspect images, and continue a long…",
      "durationInFrames": 330
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "AI Tools",
      "heading": "What hardware does Muse Glimmer need?",
      "body": "Hardware depends on the model format. Full-precision BF16 weights need much more memory than a quantized build.",
      "durationInFrames": 307
    },
    {
      "type": "point",
      "kicker": "AI Tools",
      "heading": "How to run Muse Glimmer locally",
      "body": "The simplest setup depends on your operating system and your goal. A desktop app is useful for a first test.",
